{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "040a55dd8409d9ec424a3f72965be277e28db38a61b8acf432aab5de91ba4328", "ja": "私たちが『竜宮小町』", "zh": "我们就是“龙宫小町”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "033a1b28618ee4dd8feeaffda645221404d93ee700fd213685507dd20c936cd6", "ja": "レッスンに立ち合いメンバーの仕上がりに\n満足している律子。しかし3人は律子と一緒\nに舞台に立ちたいと持ちかける。断る律子\nだったがプロデューサーにも背中を押され、\n自分もステージに立つことを決意する。", "zh": "律子在旁观训练时，对成员们的表现感到很满意。然而，3人提出想和律子一起站上舞台。虽然律子拒绝了，但在制作人的鼓励下，她也决定登上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d147b561411bd2d0dd95a0829990a648dc0627eb4d402e5b19b533f2c2b501c6", "ja": "（いよいよ『竜宮小町』のデビューライブの日時も\n決まり、ステージレッスンが始まった……）", "zh": "（终于定下了『龙宫小町』的出道演唱会日期，舞台训练也开始了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "b9ac70b93b5da00c89ee091bb9f39a9fcb72d45497282ca567411e53a642b43e", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー、ワン、ツー！\n……ふう。", "zh": "一、二、三、四，一、二！\n……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "b7cae33ffeb5881987761198d284efed422a3ff76696501e678b08754cf0c1a7", "ja": "けっこうテンポ速いわよね。\n亜美、サビ前で遅れないよう気をつけてちょうだい。", "zh": "节奏挺快的呢。  \n亚美，你可要注意别在副歌前跟不上哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "9fe91bd3805b5bae673691f3fc4707641b10d55febc80d2965fc922dad596602", "ja": "うん、いおりんは出だしんトコ気を付けてね～♪", "zh": "嗯，伊织在开头的地方也要注意哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "8c84f0195fe866d58d716db4659f97fe205e67960afe43587db1a4bd2c60c84c", "ja": "私は両方とも気をつけなくちゃ。\nもう少し、回数をこなしていきましょう。", "zh": "两边都得注意才行。再多练几遍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0678c20c1cb4222c480c6b4c26ccd908aeb340b47a348d0b02fb79afce64b7bb", "ja": "……さすが、初合わせとは思えない出来だな。", "zh": "……真厉害，完全看不出是第一次合练的水准啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1057_009rit", "source_sha256": "7496f0c189a91ed5460cdc7e9f44e49e8370550193b1c9770520387b0b7228fb", "ja": "ええ、思った以上……！\n3人ともすごいと思いません？　思いますよね？", "zh": "嗯，超出预想……！\n你不觉得包括3人在内，大家都很厉害吗？肯定觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1058_p", "source_sha256": "8202a1adc1d467c2ff795eb660d616b4e12574213b0fd3e67ac225869e00d19a", "ja": "ああ、プロデュースした人も含めると、\n4人ともすごいと思うよ。", "zh": "啊，把负责制作的人也算上的话，\n4个人都很厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1059_009rit", "source_sha256": "7a4753ed74c8a602836f43f08040d01b629631bec3638eda5b3f59c101ab1207", "ja": "あははは、ありがとうございます。\nでも、やっぱりあの3人ですよ、すごいのは。", "zh": "啊哈哈，谢谢您。\n不过，厉害的果然还是那3个人啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1060_009rit", "source_sha256": "5662b48ebe6341b481bb53614b0699e0bfd39114cee8c9803ad99dd5f1c86a1f", "ja": "ステージの主役はアイドルですからね。\nライトを浴びて、歓声と光につつまれて……。", "zh": "因为舞台的主角是偶像嘛。\n沐浴在聚光灯下，被欢呼声与光芒包围……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1061_009rit", "source_sha256": "b845bb4e152ca7cc6bd570d4657172b4b098ba5b7b5c374196ed1dbbfe08f9f3", "ja": "ふふっ、うらやましいくらい。\n……なんて、今はただの妄想ですけど。", "zh": "呵呵，真让人羡慕。\n……不过现在也只是妄想而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "cde85d7a346ac4830292fa51be62fee0844275e8c1ef2cbc85001c1c1961a994", "ja": "さ、それより仕事仕事！\nみんな、もう一度頭から合わせてみましょう！", "zh": "那么，先不说这个了，工作工作！\n大家，再从头开始合练一遍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "fefba32a73544507240fbc2317042705e5a51d062c9a534f3e3cf8a286751db6", "ja": "ちょっと待ってくれる？\nその前に、律子に話があるの。", "zh": "能等一下吗？\n在那之前，我有话要对律子说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "473d9ebdb09bee93a6da3ca5cde4fd910087c2fd25e10664111e79677a0ed536", "ja": "？　どうしたの、あらたまって……。\nあ、場所変えましょうか。", "zh": "？怎么了，突然这么郑重……？啊，要不我们换个地方吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "c6a9b06a831c5ba3a87f4f57eedb0ab29bcde8b5a5eeb45a63a7ee70bcbdb29f", "ja": "このままでいいわ、あずさと亜美とはもう話したから。\nねえ、律子。私もいろいろ考えたんだけど……。", "zh": "这样就行了，我已经和梓、亚美聊过了。\n那个，律子。我也想了很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "6902e958e690bcb801828c5c5f469bb8f9181687453f65ee36f92e5b8b78c0d2", "ja": "とりあえず、今日レッスン着持ってきてる？", "zh": "总之，你今天带练习服来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "d58b4474ea83d76f3fe45aed41bd22d0f26219c408d4be4d680b9ae499da66c5", "ja": "……は？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "f73c48a4ebfe2e223681207447488317e86e3a5d681eac17cb6719f7957ed714", "ja": "持って来てるなら着替えてきてちょうだい。\n次からレッスンに入ってもらうわ。リーダー命令よ♪", "zh": "既然你带来了，就去换好衣服。\n接下来开始参加训练。是队长的命令哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "48d7f5022d23dab8bb4ff8a5f119e3536fe55507742b4d656575848078163982", "ja": "ちょ……なに言ってるの？\n前にも言ったでしょ、私はメンバーじゃなくて……。", "zh": "等……你在说什么？\n我之前不是也说过了吗？我不是成员，而是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "392f675524965be6f829c0409fa5a9a210a164683ea38852303617786de02ac5", "ja": "プロデューサーでしょ？　そんなの知ってるわよ。\nでも、物足りないの！", "zh": "你是制作人吧？这种事我当然知道。\n可是光这样还不够！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "7599c025f104c8e06f04a4d82a49c9daec7eea5ab84eb318a6209ff2be5f996c", "ja": "いいじゃない、あんただってアイドルなんだし。\nたまにステージに出た方がサービスにもなるわ。", "zh": "有什么不好嘛，反正你也是偶像。\n偶尔登个台，还能给粉丝送点福利呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "652ed5ef4e66cd901f3199bf44c2d1776bb93518788ceffa3c86b0b03ca622de", "ja": "よくないわよ、これはユニットのコンセプト、\nバランスの問題。私は最初から数に入ってないの。", "zh": "才不好呢，这是小队的理念、\n平衡性的问题。我从一开始就不在里面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "f072708477fa02e6df9e1e8dbf4402afc654941508b140281180f7172c8291cf", "ja": "あなた達3人だけの魅力で、竜宮小町はできてる。\n実際今も、手応えがあったはずよ。……でしょ？", "zh": "龙宫小町是靠你们3个人的魅力才成立的。\n实际上刚才，你们应该也体会到了成效吧。……对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "8cea453545feafb8674170ae1ac2644ce24af9fa20e1f339802542b93e144b99", "ja": "ええ、伊織ちゃんが引っ張ってくれて、亜美ちゃんが\n盛り上げてくれて。さすが律子さんだって思いました。", "zh": "嗯，伊织带着我们，亚美又帮忙炒热气氛。真不愧是律子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "04020d3fb3b6f376d95af272bccb82156fde7a3b4de9fca555469f19db7b2559", "ja": "ただ……。私たちは、3人で竜宮小町っていうより、\n4人で竜宮小町って言える方がいいなぁ、なんて。", "zh": "只是……比起说我们是由3人组成的竜宮小町，我更希望能说我们是由4人组成的竜宮小町……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "7f64bd44f91324edbf5bfeb142d8dc3ce2c67eafd04aaf128f656c66d91b35fe", "ja": "あずささん……。", "zh": "梓小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "b5e44c1be779048593ac965376c4bd7ceb3279b400e4a8c4da74d42dab33522d", "ja": "亜美も、律っちゃんが壁際でジーッと見てるだけだと、\nなんか落ち着かないんだよ～。一緒に歌おうよ～。", "zh": "连亚美也会觉得，律子姐只是站在墙边一直盯着看，让人有点静不下心来哦～一起唱歌吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "ec393ce1cc4cb1dcaedfc0049da89392ab04bb523ed8e48876705a46fa24df17", "ja": "それとも、アイドルするのイヤになっちゃった？\nもうステージに出たくない？", "zh": "还是说，你已经不想当偶像了？\n不想再登上舞台了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "fb598743beaa45342c634f1d3a64d35f58f87897de1f50956afb5bef201c21ec", "ja": "そういうことじゃないの！　イヤになってないし、\nこれからもアイドル活動は続けるってば。", "zh": "才不是那回事！我又没有厌烦，也会继续偶像活动的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "57c1f0f6d928f2954b7742333bf34248be1a5c5d62faa0027ac8ff90fc49f4ea", "ja": "ただ、中途半端にはやりたくない。\nアイドルとしても、プロデューサーとしても。", "zh": "只是，我不想敷衍了事。\n无论是作为偶像，还是作为制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "632a3a2dce887eaecfccb08ad03cbcbde89cf1b9348f2273dda65d5479f96635", "ja": "だから、アイドルは続けるけど、竜宮小町での私は\nあくまでもプロデューサーであるべき。そう思ってる。", "zh": "所以，虽然我会继续当偶像，但在龙宫小町里，我终究应该只是制作人。我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "294643f03267ca9a2dc683b8e0b0c2aa9b32c2485ef0541dd52b2f8695fd3d2e", "ja": "……そう。わかったわ。\nどうしてもっていうなら、もう無理強いしない。", "zh": "……这样啊，我明白了。\n既然你无论如何都坚持，那我就不再强求了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "5c347a13acea91d08c07afe892c333f7928060051ed8e6c7730cf7920d68e803", "ja": "でも、これだけは覚えておいてちょうだい。\n竜宮小町は律子、あんたが作ったユニットよ。", "zh": "不过，这一点你可要记住了。\n竜宫小町可是律子你亲手打造的组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "49bdb42b99f485b18b0f6bf4d66e4c71a8655254bf727059e2cb4acaf028596a", "ja": "あんたがどこにいようとそれは変わらないし、\n3人でも4人でも、私達の魅力は1ミリも減らないわ。", "zh": "不管你在哪里，这一点都不会变，\n而且不管是3个人还是4个人，我们的魅力都丝毫不会减少1毫米。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "b0e429d6246176ecb4fc4e7883164e4a48025876691847f3fd56a4c6dec1ddd5", "ja": "たとえ、あんたが竜宮小町のセンターになってもね！", "zh": "就算你成了龙宫小町的中心，也一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "31073dacf0cb6e7e9b1b2b4bef543556ac8f55ca4f846248967d9dce229de467", "ja": "……。\nなによ、それ……。", "zh": "……。\n这叫什么话啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "959208e70f877d042136700afd0072097c6382455ddb85fb7c44e68ed1fe851f", "ja": "さっきのレッスン、律子の身体も動いてた。\nフリは全部入ってるんだよな。", "zh": "刚才的练习时，律子的身体也动得很自然。\n舞步全都记住了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3a6bf3f43e42c3ad820ac3a99943fb8338f91a7ce5e0dbf51ea9eccb26e04d18", "ja": "顔も嬉しそうに輝いてたよ。\nステージでライトを浴びてる時みたいに。", "zh": "你的脸上也洋溢着喜悦的光彩。就像在舞台上接受灯光照耀时一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "235dc92d5fd4a18883e65ba79605b57868151411abadda364c920ec0ea1335d6", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと、{$P$}まで！\n話をややこしくしないでください！", "zh": "等、等一下，连{$P$}也！请不要把事情说得这么复杂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "403aaad9487fff29c53ec26c55178e1cd5bac21c6097ec3e2a459c0eb62c1620", "ja": "ややこしいことを言ってるのは、律子じゃないかな。", "zh": "把事情说得复杂的，难道不是律子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "d03898380c5e5023ae40f18b57485d00286520655a3ef4679d9cd1e3995ce6b4", "ja": "はいぃ！？　どこがですか？\n私は至極真っ当なことを言ってるつもりですけど！？", "zh": "什么！？哪里复杂了？\n我觉得自己说的明明都是非常合理的话啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "b6ada2d252527d8480ae424b86aa209e7aaea67730e9fb0aa21e3618d40bc431", "ja": "うん。アイドルとプロデューサー、\nケジメをつけて専念するのは正しいと思う。", "zh": "嗯。偶像和制作人划分清楚、\n各司其职，我觉得确实是对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1037_p", "source_sha256": "570ee9cff199f4caa104c7b12ee29377e0a28d6fe2309a27e5cab3d3f463ecce", "ja": "でも、敢えてケジメをつけないで、臨機応変に。\n……そんな未来があってもいいと思うよ。", "zh": "不过，也可以不刻意划清界限，灵活应对。\n……我觉得，拥有那样的未来也没什么不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "e4a3b898bb213007617e121779ded4b8592857e627a5f7c4163ffe9e25c69ffb", "ja": "できるのに……。やりたい気持ちもあるのに、\nやらないなんて。単純にもったいないだろ？", "zh": "明明做得到……明明也有想做的心情，却选择不做。那不是纯粹浪费吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1039_009rit", "source_sha256": "f795aeba0d011cee552d4246746b806f95d1e370a8b786b2c4c054760f2615cf", "ja": "……。そんな、もったいないって……\n人を食べ物みたいに……。", "zh": "……居然说浪费……\n把人说得像食物一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1040_011ami", "source_sha256": "b1119a38eb172b436f10c54d6c873072869d1f1935f98923ee9f7589e9e61409", "ja": "もったいね～、もったいね～。\nアイドルが歌わないのは、超もったいね～。", "zh": "太可惜啦～，太可惜啦～。\n偶像不唱歌，简直是超级大浪费～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1041_009rit", "source_sha256": "f62ff194005266bc72c386e482d76ac50d6412568c5cd4f725b56a08eb98201f", "ja": "……怒るわよ。", "zh": "……我可要生气了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1042_011ami", "source_sha256": "074d985d4217171a2b4f3ae1e5ddbcd59ccba7443f8dab9489ffa89e71eb1e81", "ja": "はいっ、なんでもありませーん……。", "zh": "好啦，什么都没有啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1063_009rit", "source_sha256": "6dd8e270bf5c711be820029002d8348d6699920161478e4dcca5e01100f324c2", "ja": "はぁ……。みんな、本当に……、\n良くも悪くも、正直なんだから。", "zh": "唉……大家真是……不管好坏，都太坦率了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1043_009rit", "source_sha256": "fe9353b4a6941e043aa5e96937091a84faf0e61287cd1bc6f96b1bb410375d4c", "ja": "でも、そうね。どうせやるなら……\nやりたいこと、全部やってみましょうか！", "zh": "不过，确实如此。既然要做的话……\n那就把想做的事全都试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1044_007ior", "source_sha256": "6e6f51eb68d54f474b2a32a2bc7dc3f63a50eb28c3cb11e2365d7ca08a10c70a", "ja": "！　じゃあ……！", "zh": "！　那么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1045_010azu", "source_sha256": "6e6f51eb68d54f474b2a32a2bc7dc3f63a50eb28c3cb11e2365d7ca08a10c70a", "ja": "！　じゃあ……！", "zh": "！　那么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1046_011ami", "source_sha256": "6e6f51eb68d54f474b2a32a2bc7dc3f63a50eb28c3cb11e2365d7ca08a10c70a", "ja": "！　じゃあ……！", "zh": "！　那么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1047_009rit", "source_sha256": "c2a16f1e147b7705efed138e583aa752380fe4215565635ca542a3bf56c5b927", "ja": "もう。簡単に言ってくれますけど、\n両方やるのなんて、絶対大変なんだから……。", "zh": "真是的。你说得倒轻松，\n可要两边都兼顾，肯定很辛苦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1048_009rit", "source_sha256": "fd3961c3b04bdc220c9e600071a19f84ee026725abd184853244d8f85e1b26aa", "ja": "でも……そうですね。難しく考え過ぎていたのかも。\n私も竜宮小町で歌いたいです、臨機応変に。", "zh": "不过……你说得对。也许是我想得太复杂了。我也想和竜宮小町一起唱歌，灵活应对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1049_009rit", "source_sha256": "cbc6c6a863c9e9748ceb3c1e2ffe6f2e775a15c7f1d0226e3bd68b8b54fbb689", "ja": "本当に……いいのね？", "zh": "真的……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1050_007ior", "source_sha256": "f0152116409ae75af41a5a6d81baccbb6bca7f27f536437fb77704f4da56231a", "ja": "もちろん！　最初からそう言ってるじゃない。\n忙しいときに抜けるぐらいは、許してあげるわ♪", "zh": "当然啦！我一开始不就这么说了吗？忙的时候，偶尔离开一下，我还是允许的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1051_010azu", "source_sha256": "cf3eacf03502d094c87cc100bebf23ba69a23badb896f6faf44067b5eac4c2fd", "ja": "それじゃ、もう一度アタマからやりましょうか。\n今度は律子さんも一緒に。うふふ♪", "zh": "那我们再从头来一遍吧。这次也和律子一起。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1052_011ami", "source_sha256": "e9b604dc0c8fff17f48976761d0d586e833030f383e43fe0b7cf77e6e65a0bb8", "ja": "律っちゃんは最後に正式加入したから、\n亜美の後輩ね！　ねえねえ、パン買ってきて！", "zh": "律子是最后正式加入的，\n所以是亚美的后辈呢！呐呐，去帮我买个面包嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1053_009rit", "source_sha256": "a4055f6ffabda1ae150f051446ef382e18682371fd471040d47af6db311a3f30", "ja": "……ええ、いいわよ？　何がいいですか～？\n真っ赤な紅ショウガたっぷりの焼きそばパンかしら～？", "zh": "……行啊，没问题哦？你想吃什么呀～？\n放了超～多通红红姜的炒面面包如何呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1054_011ami", "source_sha256": "d08b23b438466c42b882d54469fd1f1c5e8fa7d59618f6e4aa14be8c1c2f1d16", "ja": "やっぱ、いいでーす……。", "zh": "果然，还是算了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0351_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "d604ff924209db76920619cf280e03b5839b841c9192c0a902cceb24ee74ac87", "ja": "（……プロデュースの正解はきっと一つじゃない。\n律子の企画を超える、4人の竜宮小町に期待しよう！）", "zh": "（……制作偶像的正确答案肯定不止一个。期待4人的龙宫小町超越律子的企划吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
